### PayVerse — rewards-service through the gateway. A P2P payment of INR 100+ (04-transactions.http)
### earns a scratch card; the first add-money of INR 500+ (03-wallet.http) earns INR 25.

### My totals and recent rewards
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/rewards/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### My scratch cards (amount hidden until scratched)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/rewards/scratch-cards
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% if (response.body.items.length > 0) client.global.set("cardId", response.body.items[0].id); %}

### Scratch it: the cashback reaches the wallet within a second or two
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/rewards/scratch-cards/{{cardId}}/scratch
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Coupons I can redeem
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/rewards/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Redeem the seeded coupon (once per user)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/rewards/coupons/PAYVERSE10/redeem
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### My referral code (share it: a friend enters it as referralCode in the OTP verify call of 01-auth.http)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/rewards/referral
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin: cashback rules with budget usage (ADMIN or SUPPORT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/cashback-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: create a rule (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/cashback-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WEEKEND_P2P_2PCT", "name": "2% on P2P payments of INR 500+ (max INR 20)",
  "trigger": "P2P_TRANSFER", "rewardType": "PERCENT", "percent": 2, "maxReward": 20,
  "minTxnAmount": 500, "dailyCapPerUser": 1, "budget": 5000, "priority": 50, "active": true
}

### Admin: create a coupon (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "DIWALI25", "description": "INR 25 Diwali cashback", "cashback": 25.00, "validUntil": "2026-11-30T18:29:59Z", "usageLimit": 1000 }

### Admin: deactivate a coupon
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/coupons/DIWALI25/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }
